491 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 492 0 R/Alt(Two line charts of RMS error over three control gauges in decibels against cycle number. Left panel, cycles 1 to 14: both lines start at 7.00 dB at cycle 1; the line with learning on, blue with filled circles, falls through 4.45, 2.37, 1.48 and 1.18 dB to 1.08 dB by cycle 8; the line with learning off, orange dashed with open squares, lies just above it, through 4.59, 2.55, 1.62 and 1.25 dB, and meets it at 1.08 dB from cycle 8 to 14. Right panel, cycles 5 to 60: with phase steering on, blue with filled circles, the error falls from 0.45 dB at cycle 5 to 0.06 at cycle 10, 0.02 at cycle 20 and 0.001 at cycle 60; with phase steering off, orange dashed with open squares, it falls from 0.47 dB to 0.18 dB at cycle 10 and stays at 0.18 dB.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[9]/Pg 1947 0 R>>
endobj
