<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1013 0 R/Alt(Six bar charts in three rows and two columns, nine bars each, in the order pinv_closed, pinv_open, shape_svd, buzz_match, min_drive, band_average, independent, nearly_independent, broyden_congruence, all in dB. More control gauges than shakers: control gauges 6.69, 6.10, 7.13, 6.06, 11.15, 4.84, 7.28, 5.89, 4.98; held-out gauges 6.53, 6.19, 6.94, 6.18, 11.73, 5.40, 6.64, 6.07, 5.62; stress 3.65, 3.27, 4.14, 3.06, 8.63, 3.24, 3.24, 3.15, 3.96. As many shakers as control gauges: control gauges 3.97, 4.47, 5.99, 3.90, 3.34, 2.12, 5.85, 3.71, 2.91; held-out gauges 11.02, 11.80, 6.60, 10.97, 7.79, 5.57, 6.57, 10.07, 5.70; stress 12.03, 14.42, 3.27, 11.93, 6.16, 2.71, 3.30, 10.59, 3.44.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[1]/Pg 1955 0 R>>
